WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.830
For the first guided practice we want
department-level performance The

00:00:05.843 --> 00:00:10.528
requirement says every department must appear
including departments with no admissions or

00:00:10.541 --> 00:00:17.391
no staff That tells us departments should be the
preserved population The

00:00:17.418 --> 00:00:22.631
query LEFT JOINs admissions and medical staff to
departments Because both joined

00:00:22.657 --> 00:00:26.618
tables can have multiple rows per department the
counts use DISTINCT event

00:00:26.644 --> 00:00:33.325
identifiers to avoid counting combinations as
separate admissions or staff members Run

00:00:33.352 --> 00:00:37.788
the query and look for the department with zero
activity It should

00:00:37.815 --> 00:00:43.351
still appear Also inspect average stay days and the
specialization

00:00:43.364 --> 00:00:47.840
list Notice that the result grain is one row per
department because

00:00:47.853 --> 00:00:53.080
GROUP BY is at the department level Use this example
to practice

00:00:53.106 --> 00:00:58.554
reading a longer query by sections preserved table
first relationship second relationship

00:00:58.672 --> 00:00:59.764
group and measures
